\title{Software Pipelining}
\tag{public}
\taxon{Definition}
\p{A compiler transformation that restructures a loop so the steady-state body contains instructions from \strong{multiple logical iterations}, each at a different stage — statically constructing the overlap an OoO core would find dynamically. Canonical algorithm: modulo scheduling.}
